        {
          "commit": "08a2a06e212244925423fc08d26b605edd3dcfb4",
          "git_sha": "406d354d564253f655b3a69a5eab47434b0d3121",
          "line_end": 60,
          "line_start": 51,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "locoremind/locotrainer",
          "url": "https://github.com/LocoreMind/LocoTrainer/blob/08a2a06e212244925423fc08d26b605edd3dcfb4/README.md#L51-L60"
        },
        {
          "commit": "08a2a06e212244925423fc08d26b605edd3dcfb4",
          "git_sha": "406d354d564253f655b3a69a5eab47434b0d3121",
          "line_end": 295,
          "line_start": 277,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "locoremind/locotrainer",
          "url": "https://github.com/LocoreMind/LocoTrainer/blob/08a2a06e212244925423fc08d26b605edd3dcfb4/README.md#L277-L295"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_bc87ab96fbbe3a01230c66983e153d1b0733da46b80529885494aaf31d022004",
        "slc_faa6793e3bf6c78e3238e34cb687e0ebcb1f1618c38078544f52004ba3d92352"
      ],
      "text": "The model was trained with full-parameter SFT on 361,830 samples (agent trajectories, MS-SWIFT knowledge, project paths) at 32,768 max sequence length on 8x H100 80GB for about 25 hours."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_1c72e224967adf210e6535bf25b4ab81ae999e25c1312950ea5c0fded0fb13e3",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "components",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "08a2a06e212244925423fc08d26b605edd3dcfb4",
          "git_sha": "406d354d564253f655b3a69a5eab47434b0d3121",
          "line_end": 257,
          "line_start": 244,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "locoremind/locotrainer",
          "url": "https://github.com/LocoreMind/LocoTrainer/blob/08a2a06e212244925423fc08d26b605edd3dcfb4/README.md#L244-L257"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_808adec86e02b4a1d7d5d002e1051056ea67f8cb67db127c43405808cfb905aa"
      ],
      "text": "The framework comprises modules for prompts (SYSTEM_PROMPT, get_system_reminder), a ToolExecutor (Read/Grep/Glob/Write/Bash), an agent loop, config loading, ms-swift auto-clone logic, and a Click CLI."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_0237cffb75ee9d567d6eee3d9c91565059affce0015b4512dedcd1da50762ce1",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "interfaces",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "08a2a06e212244925423fc08d26b605edd3dcfb4",
          "git_sha": "406d354d564253f655b3a69a5eab47434b0d3121",
          "line_end": 240,
          "line_start": 232,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "locoremind/locotrainer",
          "url": "https://github.com/LocoreMind/LocoTrainer/blob/08a2a06e212244925423fc08d26b605edd3dcfb4/README.md#L232-L240"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_ea9b047c61802f117b13f5563dd37bc0b5a788b62451b4b4d54cadfa8ceb0529"
      ],
      "text": "The CLI exposes `locotrainer run` with options -q (question), -c (codebase path), -o (output dir), -m (model), --max-turns (default 20), and --quiet."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
