      ],
      "text": "Configuration uses environment variables such as LOCOTRAINER_API_KEY, LOCOTRAINER_BASE_URL (default OpenAI endpoint), LOCOTRAINER_MODEL (default gpt-4o), LOCOTRAINER_MAX_TURNS, LOCOTRAINER_MAX_TOKENS, LOCOTRAINER_ENABLE_THINKING, LOCOTRAINER_CODEBASE, and LOCOTRAINER_OUTPUT_DIR."
    },
    {
