        "slc_c97164e448f6b3d1bb8d0cb689dc3c5c0d90e29a189c8b5b1210b4e495bd88e5"
      ],
      "text": "The framework simulates a Claude Code-style agent environment, matching what LocoTrainer-4B was trained on, and injects absolute paths into user content plus tolerant tool argument parsing for reliability."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_f9cd9ae874ceed0b9498fe3d2c5dc700794bfc74ae53682c71207a6eee1dbd19",
