  "summary": "LocoTrainer is a Python agent framework (pip-installable CLI) that pairs with the LocoTrainer-4B model — a Qwen3-4B-Instruct-2507 distilled via SFT from Qwen3-Coder-Next — to analyze MS-SWIFT codebases and emit markdown reports via a Claude Code-style tool-calling loop. Evidence is README-only documentation.",
  "superseded_claim_ids": []
